# The arms race pack (packs/arms_race): rabbits and wolves, each with a `speed`
# gene that moves a step at every birth (`mutate 100`). This keeps the showcase
# working, not its selection (that takes about 6 days on 128 x 128, too
# long for a test: see scenarios/arms_race.scenario): both species live, wolves hunt, genes stay in
# their range, and children whose speed drifted into a faster band become its
# coloured kind.
#
#   make run ARGS="scenario scenarios/tests/arms_race.scenario"
rules ../../rules/lib.rules ../../packs/arms_race
seed 7
size 64 64
terrain water_level 0.12 rock_on_soil 0.01 rock_on_water 0
start grass 1 / 3
start rabbit 1 / 60
start wolf 1 / 300
run 2d
expect always count rabbit >= 1
expect always count wolf >= 1
expect always min speed of rabbit >= 1
expect always max speed of rabbit <= 16
expect always min speed of wolf >= 1
expect always max speed of wolf <= 16
expect born rabbit > 1000                     # seen 2664
expect became quick_rabbit > 150              # seen 433: speeds drift up past 5
expect eaten rabbit by wolf > 150             # seen 393
expect traps rabbit == 0
expect traps wolf == 0
